WEBVTT

00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:12.221
(shouting)

00:00:31.615 --> 00:00:34.576
If it should appear
to be going poorly...
如果我看起来表现不佳

00:00:39.414 --> 00:00:41.542
Understood, Your Majesty.
我明白 陛下

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:51.844
(crowd cheering)

00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:59.226
I hope you won't be
too disappointed when I survive.
若我没死
希望你不会太失望

00:01:29.715 --> 00:01:32.342
There is still time to surrender.
要投降还来得及

00:01:34.678 --> 00:01:36.597
Well, feel free.
请便

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:39.141
How many more must die
for the throne?
为了这个王位还要死多少人？

00:01:40.142 --> 00:01:41.685
Just one.
只有一个

00:01:46.356 --> 00:01:49.151
(both shouting)

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:50.903
(crowd cheering)

00:02:07.169 --> 00:02:09.838
- (man) Ride!
- They've seen us!
快点
他们看到我们了

00:02:24.728 --> 00:02:26.980
- Take the reins.
- What are you doing?
抓好缰绳
你在干嘛？

00:02:27.064 --> 00:02:31.735
I'm sorry, Lucy. But it looks
as if you'll be going alone after all.
对不起 露西
不过看来你得一个人去了

00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:15.487
(men shouting)

00:03:29.751 --> 00:03:31.712
(man shouting)

00:03:31.795 --> 00:03:33.255
(grunts)

00:03:49.312 --> 00:03:51.314
Are you sure you don't need that horn?
你确定你不需要这个号角？

00:04:00.824 --> 00:04:02.409
Ah!

00:04:07.372 --> 00:04:09.666
(crowd cheering)

00:04:11.585 --> 00:04:13.587
(grunting)

00:04:16.506 --> 00:04:17.758
Ah!

00:04:24.681 --> 00:04:27.851
- Ah!
- (growling)

00:04:37.652 --> 00:04:39.863
- Ah!
- (grunts)

00:04:43.033 --> 00:04:44.034
(groaning)

00:05:07.808 --> 00:05:11.103
Does His Highness need a respite?
殿下需要休息吗？

00:05:11.186 --> 00:05:12.813
Five minutes?
五分钟？

00:05:14.106 --> 00:05:15.315
Three!
三分钟

